\begin_layout Itemize
Sea 
\begin_inset Formula $I(z_K,z_L)=p\big(F(z_K,z_L)\big)\,F(z_K,z_L)$
\end_inset

 el ingreso, con 
\begin_inset Formula $I_i=\mathrm{IMg}\cdot\mathrm{PMg}_i$
\end_inset

. La restricciÃ³n de rentabilidad es 
\begin_inset Formula $I-w_Lz_L\leq s\,z_K$
\end_inset

. Con su multiplicador 
\begin_inset Formula $\mu\geq 0$
\end_inset

, el problema penalizado es 
\begin_inset Formula \[
  I-w_Kz_K-w_Lz_L-\mu\,\big[I-w_Lz_L-s\,z_K\big].
  \]
\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\emph on
CondiciÃ³n de primer orden respecto a 
\begin_inset Formula $z_L$
\end_inset


\emph default
: 
\begin_inset Formula $(1-\mu)\,I_L-(1-\mu)\,w_L=0\Rightarrow I_L=w_L$
\end_inset

. 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\emph on
CondiciÃ³n de primer orden respecto a 
\begin_inset Formula $z_K$
\end_inset


\emph default
: 
\begin_inset Formula $(1-\mu)\,I_K-w_K+\mu\,s=0\Rightarrow I_K=\dfrac{w_K-\mu s}{1-\mu}=w_K-\dfrac{\mu}{1-\mu}\,(s-w_K)$
\end_inset

. 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\emph on
Signo del multiplicador
\emph default
